@bcherny Hey Boris, could you please escalate this?

Currently, the only workaround is manually adding the plugin root directory path as an environment variable in settings.local.json, which doesn't scale well across users or installations.

It would be really useful if plugin skills, slash commands and subagents could natively access plugin scripts via a standardized environment variable (like CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT and CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR). This would enable more creative automation workflows witho
